  "title": "Make Claude Build Websites That Don't Look AI-Made",
  "description": "Most AI-built websites look generic and templated. This free four-tool stack on top of Claude Code fixes that: an animation skill for real motion, the UI/UX Pro Max skill for clean non-AI-looking interfaces, and 21st.dev for a huge library of pre-built components. You describe the site, pick a design, and Claude assembles it.\n\nGet the full stack with the exact setup here: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1zAQ3QBWqObGj7FFjTY-k-6X04SJb6mOd3Lxh4rx_HJc/edit?usp=sharing\n\n#Shorts #Claude #WebDesign",
